OL,5,G0900 Saturday Morning
OL,6,     FTom Service talks to pianist Dame
OL,7,     FImogen Cooper about her life in
OL,8,     Fmusic, and saxophonist Salvador
OL,9,     FFlores plays live in the studio.
OL,10,G1200 Earlier... with Jools Holland
OL,11,     FJools is joined by the Duran Duran
OL,12,     Fsinger Simon Le Bon, with music by
OL,13,     FSibelius, Purcell and Meredith
OL,14,     FMonk.
OL,15,G1300 Key Changes: Radio 3's...
OL,16,     F...Essential History of Classical
OL,17,     FMusic. 1846, Birmingham. The
OL,18,     Fpremiere of Mendelssohn's Elijah
OL,19,     Fputs the city on the musical map.
