OL,5,G1400 Record Review
OL,6,     FAndrew McGregor with the best of
OL,7,     Fthe week's new classical releases,
OL,8,     Fjoined by Allyson Devenish and
OL,9,     FDavid Owen Norris, who surveys
OL,10,     Frecordings of Walton's
OL,11,     FBelshazzar's Feast.
OL,12,G1600 Sound of Cinema
OL,13,     FEdith Bowman presents a showcase
OL,14,     Fof screen music favourites. This
OL,15,     Fweek, Composer and conductor
OL,16,     FRupert Gregson-Williams discuss
OL,17,     Fhis brand new score to Practical
OL,18,     FMagic 2.
