OL,5,G1700 This Classical Life
OL,6,     FJess Gillam is joined by American
OL,7,     Fpianist Simone Dinnerstein for a
OL,8,     Flistening party, including music
OL,9,     Fby Charles Ives, Michael
OL,10,     FPraetorius and Bob Dylan.
OL,11,G1800 Opera on 3
OL,12,     FLisette Oropesa stars as Elvira in
OL,13,     FBellini's bel canto masterpiece
OL,14,     Ffrom The Royal Opera, where love,
OL,15,     Floyalty and civil war drive her to
OL,16,     Fthe brink of despair and
OL,17,     Fheartbreak.
